<title>PHILIPPINES: Manila firms invite tenders for 35,000 T U.S wheat.</title>
<headline>Manila firms invite tenders for 35,000 T U.S wheat.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Philippine firms have invited tenders on Tuesday to buy 35,000 tonnes of U.S. wheat, traders said.</p>
<p>The firms asked price quotes from commodity houses for the supply of 29,000 tonnes dark northern spring wheat and 6,000 tonnes of western white wheat.</p>
<p>Other details of the tenders were not immediately available.</p>
<p>--Manila newsroom (632) 841-89-36, fax 817-62-67</p>
